<title>SOUTH AFRICA: COURT APPROVES BARLOW, BIBBY DEAL.</title>
<headline>COURT APPROVES BARLOW, BIBBY DEAL.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-06-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Africa's Barlow Ltd said on Tuesday that the British High Court had sanctioned the scheme of arrangement through which Britain's J.Bibby and Sons Plc will become a wholly-owned subsidiary.</p>
<p>&quot;The full integration of Bibby's operations into the Barlows group is a logical step in the further development of Barlows, and will result in enhanced flexibility in managing and funding our international operations,&quot; said Barlows chairman Warren Clewlow.</p>
<p>Bibby has operations in Europe and the U.S. with three divisions -- materials handling, capital equipment and industrial.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
